   "review_date": "2017-08-05 01:28:13",
   "review_text": "What a beautiful place and relaxing atmosphere. The accommodations are fairly comfortable, but it's the grounds that make this gem of a place special. (The food doesn't hurt either.) Get a massage from Vesalina if at all possible; it was the best I've ever had. Also, be sure to check out the gardens and chapels."
